<p><span id="u-credit-00248" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00248" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00248-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aral-see" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3967270); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3967270&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511503" alt="Dr Aral See" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3967270)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aral-see" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3967270); return false;">Dr Aral See</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1591581648 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">08 Jun 2020 02:00</span></p>
